<title>PAKISTAN: PAKISTAN'S ENGRO FIRST HALF NET DOWN.</title>
<headline>PAKISTAN'S ENGRO FIRST HALF NET DOWN.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half ended June 30, 1997 (in million rupees)</p>
<p>    Sales		     2,465 vs 3,027</p>
<p>    Profit before tax	 382 vs   583</p>
<p>    Profit after tax	  359 vs   529</p>
<p>    First interim div    25 pct vs    30 pct per 10-rupee share</p>
<p>NOTE - Engro Chemical Pakistan Ltd manufactures fertilisers. It said unappropriated profit stood at 361 million rupees on June 30 vs 529 million. Book closure September 16-30. Ex-dividend date September 16.</p>
<p>-- Ibrahim Khan (9221) 5685192; Fax (9221) 5673428</p>
